    "detailed_description": "UC KART is a racing game for 1 to 4 players. There is HP in the car. When HP reaches zero, the game is over. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527230/extras/3442b3d922029856562f5b93ecd8408e.avif?t=1667110226\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Equipped with color edit function</h2>You can change the color of the car and the driver. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527230/extras/a8a8dcfb2649560adebfc285a6a6dcd2.avif?t=1667110226\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single play support</h2>You can play against the CPU.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online play support</h2>You can play against other players online.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2>\u3010Keyboard\u3011<br>UP:w,\u2191<br>DOWN:s,\u2193<br>LEFT:a,\u2190<br>RIGHT:d,\u2192<br>ACCEL:j,v<br>BRAKE&amp;BACK:k,c<br>PAUSE:Escape<br><br>\u3010PS4 Controller\u3011<br>UP:Left Stick<br>DOWN:Left Stick<br>LEFT:Left Stick<br>RIGHT:Left Stick<br>ACCEL:\u3007<br>BRAKE&amp;BACK:\u00d7<br>PAUSE:option<br><br>\u3010XBox Controller\u3011<br>UP:Left Stick<br>DOWN:Left Stick<br>LEFT:Left Stick<br>RIGHT:Left Stick<br>ACCEL:B<br>BRAKE&amp;BACK:A<br>PAUSE:menu",
